# TD Realty Ohio - URL Canonicalization
# ========================================

# Host canonicalization: www to non-www
# (Cloudflare Pages handles this at the edge)
https://www.tdrealtyohio.com/* https://tdrealtyohio.com/:splat 301

# Canonical URL strategy:
# - Clean routes with trailing slashes (e.g., /sellers/) are canonical
# - .html URLs redirect to clean routes (301)
# - Non-trailing-slash URLs redirect to trailing-slash canonical (301)
# - Directories use trailing slash (e.g., /areas/, /blog/)

